  TitleText: WELCOME
  TitleFontSize: 2.74
  TitleOffset: 0.1
  BodyText: "This app demonstrates key features of the Timeflow animation system
    for Unity. To use this app, tap on widgets in the control panel to view details
    and load additional demos. \n\nAll of the animations and dynamic movements in
    this app have been created using Timeflow. The full source to this app is included
    in the examples.\n\nPlease visit the Unity Asset Store to purchase a license
    for Timeflow."
